WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.306 --> 00:00:13.841
&gt;&gt; Laura: THE BROWARD COUNTY

00:00:13.073 --> 00:00:16.543
SHERIFF'S OFFICE IS IN FULL CYA

00:00:13.974 --> 00:00:17.711
MODE THIS EVENING PUSHING BACK

00:00:16.677 --> 00:00:20.013
AGAINST AN AVALANCHE OF

00:00:17.845 --> 00:00:21.181
CRITICISM ABOUT QUESTIONS OF ITS

00:00:20.147 --> 00:00:23.350
CONDUCT DURING THE STONEMAN

00:00:21.515 --> 00:00:24.084
DOUGLAS SCHOOL SHOOTING.

00:00:23.484 --> 00:00:26.787
THAT INCLUDES INFORMATION FIRST

00:00:24.218 --> 00:00:28.121
REPORTED EXCLUSIVELY ON THE

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:29.389
ANGLE WHEN A WELL-PLACED SOURCE

00:00:28.255 --> 00:00:33.293
TOLD US THAT DEPUTIES WERE TOLD

00:00:29.523 --> 00:00:34.061
NOT TO ENTER THE SCHOOL DURING

00:00:33.427 --> 00:00:36.363
THE SHOOTING AND LESS THEIR BODY

00:00:34.194 --> 00:00:37.598
CAMERAS WERE ON.

00:00:36.497 --> 00:00:39.566
I CHARGE NOW BEING DENIED.

00:00:37.731 --> 00:00:40.968
THE SHERIFF'S OFFICE IS ALSO

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:41.602
DENYING REPORTS THAT A CAPTAIN

00:00:41.101 --> 00:00:43.971
TOLD DEPUTIES TO FORM A

00:00:41.735 --> 00:00:45.138
PERIMETER AROUND THE SCENE

00:00:44.104 --> 00:00:45.572
INSTEAD OF GOING INTO CONFRONT

00:00:45.272 --> 00:00:47.941
THE SHOOTER.

00:00:45.706 --> 00:00:49.743
IT SAYS THE PERIMETER WAS FORMED

00:00:48.075 --> 00:00:50.711
AFTER THE SHOOTING HAD STOPPED.

00:00:49.877 --> 00:00:54.248
JOINING US NOW WITH REACTION IS

00:00:50.844 --> 00:00:54.982
JEFF BELL, PRESIDENT OF THE

00:00:54.381 --> 00:00:58.418
SHERIFF DEPUTIES ASSOCIATION AND

00:00:55.115 --> 00:01:00.187
FORMER L.A. POLICE DETECTIVE

00:00:58.552 --> 00:01:00.988
MARK

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:01.889
MARK FUHRMAN.

00:01:01.121 --> 00:01:04.157
DRAFT, LET'S START WITH YOU.

00:01:02.022 --> 00:01:04.825
THEY WERE ISSUING TODAY AFTER

00:01:04.291 --> 00:01:08.695
ALL THESE DAYS THAT THESE

00:01:04.958 --> 00:01:09.162
REPORTS WERE OUT THERE A FLURRY

00:01:08.829 --> 00:01:11.365
OF DENIALS.

00:01:09.296 --> 00:01:12.766
LET ME READ TO YOU WHAT THE

00:01:11.498 --> 00:01:15.168
BROWARD SHERIFF'S OFFICE SAID IN

00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:16.737
ITS FACT-CHECK ON BODY CAMERAS.

00:01:15.302 --> 00:01:17.771
ANY SUGGESTION THAT PARIS GOT

00:01:16.870 --> 00:01:19.973
ISRAEL OR ANY OTHER DEPUTY FROM

00:01:17.905 --> 00:01:22.342
BROWARD SHERIFF'S OFFICE ORDERED

00:01:20.107 --> 00:01:26.547
BODY CAMERAS TO BE TURNED ON

00:01:22.476 --> 00:01:26.980
PRIOR TO ENTERING THE SCHOOLS IS

00:01:26.680 --> 00:01:28.315
FALSE.

00:01:27.114 --> 00:01:30.517
WHAT'S YOUR REACTION TO THAT?

00:01:28.448 --> 00:01:32.052
WE HAVE TWO WELL-PLACED SOURCES

00:01:30.651 --> 00:01:35.389
TELL US THAT IN FACT IT WAS THE

00:01:32.185 --> 00:01:36.456
CASE THAT THEY WERE TOLD NOT TO

00:01:35.522 --> 00:01:39.760
ENTER UNLESS THEY HAD THEIR BODY

00:01:36.590 --> 00:01:41.995
CAMERAS ON.

00:01:39.893 --> 00:01:42.763
&gt;&gt; I THINK THIS JUST FURTHER

00:01:42.129 --> 00:01:43.630
AFFIRMS THE UNION'S POSITION

00:01:42.896 --> 00:01:45.732
THAT WE ARE CALLING FOR THE

00:01:43.764 --> 00:01:47.668
BROWARD SHERIFF'S OFFICE TO BE

00:01:45.866 --> 00:01:48.602
TOTALLY TRANSPARENT IN THIS

00:01:47.801 --> 00:01:50.571
INVESTIGATION TO RELEASE THE

00:01:48.735 --> 00:01:51.171
INFORMATION OUT THERE BECAUSE BY

00:01:50.704 --> 00:01:53.240
RELEASING PARTS OF THIS

00:01:51.305 --> 00:01:55.142
INFORMATION THAT THEY HAVE TODAY

00:01:53.373 --> 00:01:56.276
JUST FURTHER CREATES MORE

00:01:55.275 --> 00:01:57.210
SPECULATION THAT THERE IS SOME

00:01:56.410 --> 00:01:58.679
HIDDEN TRUTH BACK THERE.

00:01:57.344 --> 00:02:00.847
THERE MAY OR MAY NOT BE, BUT IT

00:01:58.812 --> 00:02:02.549
SURE DOES GIVE THE APPEARANCE

00:02:00.981 --> 00:02:03.383
THAT SOMETHING IS BEING HIDDEN

00:02:02.683 --> 00:02:04.318
FROM THE PUBLIC.

00:02:03.517 --> 00:02:08.855
&gt;&gt; Laura: MARK, THERE SEEMS TO

00:02:04.451 --> 00:02:12.159
HAVE BEEN QUITE A LAG IN THE

00:02:08.989 --> 00:02:16.363
SHERIFF'S OFFICE RELEASING THESE

00:02:12.292 --> 00:02:17.030
CLARIFICATIONS FACT CHECKS.

00:02:16.496 --> 00:02:20.534
AN ENORMOUS PRESSURE SCOTT

00:02:17.164 --> 00:02:23.370
ISRAEL TO RESIGN GIVEN THE

00:02:20.667 --> 00:02:24.171
REPEATED VISITS TO THE

00:02:23.503 --> 00:02:28.375
HOUSEHOLD, THE RED FLAGS, ONE

00:02:24.304 --> 00:02:29.776
AFTER THE OTHER MIST.

00:02:28.508 --> 00:02:30.577
THIS IDEA THAT THERE WAS A

00:02:29.910 --> 00:02:32.245
PERIMETER SET UP.

00:02:30.711 --> 00:02:33.180
THAT WAS ONLY SET UP AFTER THE

00:02:32.379 --> 00:02:33.914
SHOOTING HAD CEASED.

00:02:33.313 --> 00:02:37.884
FROM WHAT YOU ARE GATHERING AND

00:02:34.047 --> 00:02:39.052
WHAT YOU HAVE SEEN, WHAT'S YOUR

00:02:38.018 --> 00:02:44.858
REACTION TO THESE SERIES OF FACT

00:02:39.186 --> 00:02:47.761
CHECKS RELEASED TODAY?

00:02:44.992 --> 00:02:48.462
&gt;&gt; IF I WAS ASSUMING WITH HIS

00:02:47.894 --> 00:02:49.730
CAPTAIN, THIS FEMALE CAPTAIN

00:02:48.595 --> 00:02:51.898
ORDERED A PERIMETER TO BE SET UP

00:02:49.863 --> 00:02:55.202
WHILE SHE WAS NOT AT THE SCENE,

00:02:52.032 --> 00:02:55.869
THAT WOULD GO AGAINST EVERY

00:02:55.335 --> 00:02:58.872
TACTICAL OPERATION THAT I'VE

00:02:56.003 --> 00:03:02.242
EVER HEARD OF.

00:02:59.006 --> 00:03:04.511
THE PEOPLE THAT WERE IN CHARGE

00:03:02.376 --> 00:03:05.212
OF THAT SCENE WHERE THE DEPUTIES

00:03:04.645 --> 00:03:07.247
THAT FIRST ARRIVED.

00:03:05.345 --> 00:03:08.015
THEY WERE IN CHARGE OF THAT

00:03:07.381 --> 00:03:10.083
TACTICAL SEEM TO MAKE THE CALLS

00:03:08.148 --> 00:03:11.952
APPEAR TO HAVE ANYBODY MAKE ANY

00:03:10.217 --> 00:03:14.287
KIND OF CALL ON THE RADIO IS

00:03:12.085 --> 00:03:16.323
INCOMPETENCE AT THE VERY BEST,

00:03:14.421 --> 00:03:18.358
AND PROBABLY GETS WORSE FROM

00:03:16.456 --> 00:03:19.660
THERE.

00:03:18.492 --> 00:03:23.263
IT SEEMS THAT THERE IS NOTHING

00:03:19.793 --> 00:03:24.765
THAT THEY CAN ACCOUNT FOR

00:03:23.397 --> 00:03:26.500
IMMEDIATELY.

00:03:24.898 --> 00:03:32.172
IT TAKES THEM A WEEK, TEN DAYS

00:03:26.633 --> 00:03:34.341
TO COME UP WITH AN EXCUSE.

00:03:32.305 --> 00:03:38.145
THOSE DEPUTIES DIDN'T GO IN FOR

00:03:34.474 --> 00:03:40.180
A REASON.

00:03:38.278 --> 00:03:40.614
THOSE DEPUTIES ARE DEPUTIES,

00:03:40.313 --> 00:03:41.481
THEY ARE COPS.

00:03:40.747 --> 00:03:44.184
THERE IS A SITUATION THERE AND

00:03:41.615 --> 00:03:44.918
THEY WANT TO WAIT FOR AN ORDER.

00:03:44.317 --> 00:03:45.852
THEY CAPABLE AND TRAIN AND THEY

00:03:45.052 --> 00:03:46.186
NEED TO GO IN AND CONFRONT THE

00:03:45.986 --> 00:03:48.689
SHOOTER.

00:03:46.319 --> 00:03:51.591
THAT WAS THEIR JOB.

00:03:48.822 --> 00:03:53.293
&gt;&gt; Laura: WHEN YOU GO BACK AND

00:03:51.725 --> 00:03:56.196
LOOK AT THIS HORRIFIC SITUATION,

00:03:53.427 --> 00:03:57.597
HORRIFIC SHOOTING, WE ALL KNOW,

00:03:56.329 --> 00:03:59.800
WE SUPPORT OUR POLICE.

00:03:57.731 --> 00:04:00.701
WE LOVE OUR POLICE OFFICERS, WE

00:03:59.933 --> 00:04:02.769
LOVE OUR FIRST RESPONDERS, BUT

00:04:00.834 --> 00:04:11.111
WE ALSO CAN LEARN FROM WHAT

00:04:02.903 --> 00:04:11.745
HAPPENED ON THAT DATE.

00:04:11.244 --> 00:04:12.245
IF IT WANTS TO RUN TO GUN

00:04:11.878 --> 00:04:13.013
CONTROL, I GET IT.

00:04:12.379 --> 00:04:13.580
THAT'S WITH THE LEFT WILL DO AND

00:04:13.146 --> 00:04:14.314
EVEN SOME REPUBLICANS.

00:04:13.714 --> 00:04:15.482
BUT WE DO HAVE SOME BASIC FACTS

00:04:14.448 --> 00:04:18.452
THAT ARE JUST FACTS THAT WE

00:04:15.615 --> 00:04:19.186
WOULD CERTAINLY LEARN ABOUT IF

00:04:18.585 --> 00:04:25.392
WE HAD THE POLICE TRANSMISSION

00:04:19.319 --> 00:04:26.893
OVER THE RADIO RELEASED.

00:04:25.525 --> 00:04:28.161
WE HAVE THE LAS VEGAS SHOOTING

00:04:27.027 --> 00:04:29.396
WHERE WE STILL HAVEN'T SEEN

00:04:28.295 --> 00:04:30.597
VIDEOTAPES OF THE SHOOTER

00:04:29.529 --> 00:04:31.732
CHECKING INTO THE HOTEL,

00:04:30.731 --> 00:04:32.833
BRINGING ALL THE BAGS.

00:04:31.865 --> 00:04:35.602
JUST LIKE IT NEVER HAPPEN.

00:04:32.966 --> 00:04:36.770
WE NEVER SEE THE VIDEO.

00:04:35.736 --> 00:04:40.173
WHY HAVEN'T WE SEEN MORE VIDEO

00:04:36.903 --> 00:04:41.408
AND WHY HAVEN'T WE HEARD THE

00:04:40.307 --> 00:04:44.311
AUDIO OF THE POLICE RESPONSE?

00:04:41.541 --> 00:04:46.213
JEFF, I WOULD LIKE YOUR RESPONSE

00:04:44.444 --> 00:04:46.980
AND THEN MARK VERY QUICKLY.

00:04:46.346 --> 00:04:47.948
&gt;&gt; THAT'S THE MILLION-DOLLAR

00:04:47.114 --> 00:04:49.783
QUESTION THAT NOBODY KNOWS THE

00:04:48.081 --> 00:04:50.817
ANSWER TO AND THAT'S WHERE WE

00:04:49.916 --> 00:04:51.384
ARE DEMANDING THE TRANSPARENCY

00:04:50.951 --> 00:04:52.986
ON THIS.

00:04:51.518 --> 00:04:54.187
IF WE DID SOMETHING WRONG, WE

00:04:53.120 --> 00:04:55.622
DID SOMETHING WRONG.

00:04:54.321 --> 00:04:55.989
LET'S LEARN FROM THIS AND MOVE

00:04:55.756 --> 00:04:57.023
FORWARD.

00:04:56.123 --> 00:04:58.492
THE ONLY WAY TO RECOGNIZE THAT

00:04:57.157 --> 00:05:00.193
THERE'S A PROBLEM IS TO ACTUALLY

00:04:58.625 --> 00:05:01.328
BE HONEST AND TRUTHFUL FOR IT.

00:05:00.327 --> 00:05:05.398
WE HAVE TO MOVE FORWARD WITH

00:05:01.461 --> 00:05:08.135
BETTER TRAINING IN THIS AGENCY.

00:05:05.532 --> 00:05:08.902
I'VE SAID IT BEFORE,

00:05:08.268 --> 00:05:09.903
$887 MILLION REVISED BUDGET LAST

00:05:09.035 --> 00:05:11.404
YEAR AND THE SHERIFF'S OFFICE

00:05:10.036 --> 00:05:11.772
AND WE DON'T EVEN HAVE OUR OWN

00:05:11.538 --> 00:05:13.206
GUN RANGE.

00:05:11.905 --> 00:05:14.875
THAT'S UNACCEPTABLE IN THE

00:05:13.340 --> 00:05:16.510
TRAINING WE DO HAVE, I HAVE TO

00:05:15.008 --> 00:05:17.177
GIVE CREDIT TO THE SERGEANTS AND

00:05:16.643 --> 00:05:18.779
DEPUTIES THAT HAVE LARGER

00:05:17.310 --> 00:05:19.279
CLASSES WITH WHAT LITTLE THEY

00:05:18.912 --> 00:05:20.514
HAVE TO WORK WITH.

00:05:19.412 --> 00:05:22.616
IF WE ARE GOING TO GET SERIOUS

00:05:20.647 --> 00:05:23.683
ABOUT PROBLEMS LIKE THIS AND

00:05:22.749 --> 00:05:24.851
ADDRESSING THE NEXT PROBLEM THAT

00:05:23.817 --> 00:05:26.686
COMES DOWN THE ROAD, WE HAVE TO

00:05:24.985 --> 00:05:29.122
LOOK AT OURSELVES AND LEARN FROM

00:05:26.820 --> 00:05:29.456
INSTANCES LIKE THIS AND MOVE

00:05:29.256 --> 00:05:30.257
FORWARD.

00:05:29.589 --> 00:05:34.494
&gt;&gt; Laura: MARK?

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:34.828
&gt;&gt; WE DON'T NEED TO WAIT FOR THE

00:05:34.628 --> 00:05:35.796
VIDEOS.

00:05:34.961 --> 00:05:37.030
CAN YOU IMAGINE HOW MANY 911

00:05:35.929 --> 00:05:38.532
CALLS CAME OUT FROM THOSE

00:05:37.164 --> 00:05:40.534
CHILDREN INSIDE THAT SCHOOL?

00:05:38.665 --> 00:05:41.968
THERE WAS PROBABLY A THOUSAND,

00:05:40.667 --> 00:05:44.571
2,000 SALVOS IN THAT SCHOOL.

00:05:42.102 --> 00:05:45.906
HOW ABOUT RELEASING SOME OF THE

00:05:44.704 --> 00:05:46.573
911 CALLS, BECAUSE THAT SHOULD

00:05:46.039 --> 00:05:48.141
HAVE BEEN RELAYED TO THOSE

00:05:46.706 --> 00:05:50.410
OFFICERS THAT WERE RESPONDING

00:05:48.275 --> 00:05:53.680
EXACTLY WHAT WAS GOING DOWN.

00:05:50.544 --> 00:05:56.983
NOBODY THOUGHT THERE WERE SHOTS

00:05:53.814 --> 00:05:58.518
OUTSIDE.

00:05:57.117 --> 00:06:00.554
LET'S ACTUALLY GET REAL HERE.

00:05:58.652 --> 00:06:02.389
EVERYBODY KNEW WHAT WAS GOING

00:06:00.687 --> 00:06:03.190
DOWN.

